# Testing (Workspace)

**Extends**: `testing-discipline.mdc` (parent). Load both when globs match.

## Config

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| Root | `pytest.ini` — `pythonpath = libs services/universal-stargate` |
| Discovery | `test_*.py`, `*_test.py`; `norecursedirs` includes `tmp` |
| Venv | `$HOME/.venvs/universal` |

## Default verify stack

```
VERIFY_default ≡ ruff_check ∧ ruff_format ∧ compileall   (core_ws)
VERIFY_test    ≡ pytest_narrow_path   (additive when test file touched)
VERIFY_default ∧ (test_changed ⟹ VERIFY_test)
```

## Examples

```bash
# Migration + registry (email-capture pattern)
pytest libs/cortex_store/test_correspondence_registration_migration.py -q

# Package suite
pytest libs/cortex_store/ -q --ignore=...   # prefer single file when possible
```

