## Anti-patterns

| Bad | Good |
|-----|------|
| Root orphan `test_foo.py` undiscovered by `pytest.ini` | Colocate under `libs/<pkg>/` |
| `tmp/prompts/` test as only copy | Implement under `libs/`; phase spec references path |
| "Tests pass" with no pytest line | Quote `N passed` from tool output |
